OL,3,GNEWSALove Island star praises foster
OL,4,Aparents
OL,5,
OL,6,FLove Island's Ope Sowande says his
OL,7,Fparents, who fostered him at three
OL,8,Fmonths old, are "the reason I'm here
OL,9,Ftoday".
OL,11,FThe 27-year-old West End performer was
OL,12,Fan Islander on season 13 of the reality
OL,13,FTV show, which he was on for almost two
OL,14,Fweeks.
OL,16,FSowande was born in Hackney but brought
OL,17,Fup in Boston, Lincolnshire, after he
OL,18,Fwas fostered by parents Pauline and
OL,19,FBarry.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
